# DA Screen agent team

When the user addresses the **orchestration agent**, gives it a task, or asks to refactor/test this app via the agent team:

1. Read and follow `~/.cursor/skills/da-screen-orchestrator/SKILL.md`
2. Dispatch backend work per `~/.cursor/skills/da-screen-backend/SKILL.md`
3. Dispatch frontend work per `~/.cursor/skills/da-screen-frontend/SKILL.md`
4. Do not implement backend API or React UI in the parent agent; the orchestrator tests and accepts sub-agent work

API contract: `~/.cursor/skills/da-screen-orchestrator/contract.md`
